OL,3,GNEWSASecond arrest after fire in
OL,4,Atop-floor flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a fire in
OL,7,Fa top-floor flat spread to the
OL,8,Fbuilding's roof space.
OL,10,FFirefighters were called to Keel House,
OL,11,Fa block of 32 flats on Dorchester Road
OL,12,Fin Weymouth, shortly before 01:00 BST
OL,13,Fon Sunday.
OL,15,FDorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,16,Fsaid 30 firefighters worked to tackle
OL,17,Fthe flames at the height of the blaze.
OL,18,FThe building was fully evacuated, with
OL,19,Fresidents taken to temporary
OL,20,Faccommodation. No injuries were
OL,21,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
