OL,3,GNEWSASecond arrest after fire in
OL,4,Atop-floor flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Police said a man arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson with intent to
OL,8,Fendanger life remained in police
OL,9,Fcustody. The force added that a woman
OL,10,Farrested on suspicion of the same
OL,11,Foffence had been released on police
OL,12,Fbail.
